---
title: Plans you can act on
date: '2026-06-16'
tags:
  - added
  - changed
summary: The three generated implementation plans can be expanded, rated, and stored in the default file-backed store. Analysis cost remains an estimate when usage and model price are available.
---
Analysis results stopped being a wall of text this milestone.

- **Functional plan reveal** — the three implementation plans render as actionable, explorable output rather than a static blob.
- **Plan-feedback capture** — record which plan was useful.
- **Durable file-backed storage** for analyses, plus a Vitest test suite.

Anthropic pricing and context-window data in the model registry were revised.
An analysis cost is still an estimate from configured prices, conditional on provider-reported usage.

The earlier paired images showed the provider-setup state and carried obsolete
“exact token cost” copy. They have been withdrawn; a real paired capture of the
current result and plans is still needed.
